  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CADEC Masvingo- LPPZ-Fertiliser Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at complimenting the Emergency Food Security programme in eight wards in Bikita and Gutu sistricts in Masvingo Province of Zimbabwe. The EFSP has been providing food support to the beneficiaries in the selected wards of the district and this project will ensure that the households that receive food will be able to produce enough food to feed themselves in 2009/10. Soil fertility being the most limiting factor to crop production besides water, it is important that fertiliser be distributed to the food beneficiaries so that they can improve food production at household level for the coming year.</narrative>
  </description>
